{
 "brief": "The head of the International Union of Muslim Scholars called for transforming the International Day of Solidarity with Palestine into tangible action rather than slogans, Shehab Wire reported. Al-Qaradawi stressed that Palestine represents a cause for all humanity, not merely one religious or national constituency.\n\nHe emphasized that genuine solidarity requires concrete steps beyond statements and declarations. The appeal came as organizations worldwide mark the annual day dedicated to Palestinian rights and resistance.",
